{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/39579-spirits-crossing-the-gauntlet","id":39579,"title":"Spirits crossing the Gauntlet","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-30T14:11:01-08:00","id":39579,"title":"Spirits crossing the Gauntlet","content":"While rereading the spirit rules in multiple books (Forsaken, Book of Spirits, etc.) I noticed that it is never stated how spirits cross the Gauntlet. There are a few Numina that accomplish it, but it is also implied that spirits can cross at a Locus without a Numen, gaining +2 on the roll. I can't seem to find what roll this is and how crossing the Gauntlet without Numina works.<br /> <br /> Am I missing something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":304,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/304-penta","user":"Penta","date":".  Clarity 12-30-2013, 05:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/304-penta","name":"Penta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar304_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"617"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T14:48:48-08:00","id":39610,"title":"","content":"The Gauntlet Breach numina is the most reliable way for spirits to enter the real world. They also use the Materialize numina.<br /> Gauntlet Breach is comparable to werewolf stepping sideways, I don't believe spirits have an inherent way to get across (or else a werewolfs job would be a lot harder).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 12-30-2013, 05:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T15:01:53-08:00","id":39617,"title":"","content":"The book does say the following:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Forsaken p. 269</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">If not for the Gauntlet, the physical world might have been flooded by spirits long ago. As it is, most spirits can slip through only at a locus where the Gauntlet is weak (and even then they must be attuned to its resonance).</div> </div> </div> </div>Furthermore Spirits are listed as &quot;Creatures who aren\u2019t werewolves but are otherwise capable of crossing between worlds at a locus&quot; on page 251. So I assumed spirits could cross the Gauntlet at loci without Numina.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/304-penta","name":"Penta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar304_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"617"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-04T17:11:46-08:00","id":42568,"title":"","content":"Standard Power+Finesse roll penalized by the gauntlet's thickness. Gauntlet Breach allows the spirit to wave the need of a locus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}